/-! ### Problem 1: Dimension and Connectedness -/
#eval "Prove: a zero-dimensional space is totally disconnected. Show the converse fails in general."

/-! ### Problem 2: Continua and Endpoints -/
#eval "Classify all continua with finitely many endpoints. Prove every dendrite has at most countably many endpoints."

/-! ### Problem 3: Universal Totally Disconnected -/
#eval "Construct the totally disconnected reflection of a space X. Prove its universal property."

/-! ### Problem 4: Pseudo-Arc Uniqueness -/
#eval "Prove the pseudo-arc is unique up to homeomorphism. Show it is homogeneous."

/-! ### Problem 5: Continua in R^n -/
#eval "Prove every continuum in R^2 has the fixed point property. Is this true in R^3?"

